{"kind":"table","sheet":"Music outreach","address":"A1:L10","rows":10,"cols":12,"values":[["ID","Organization / event","Route","Status","Last outreach","Reply date","Next action","Careers / opportunities","Contact / email thread","Pay","9-to-5 fit","Notes"],["FVDED-2027","FVDED in the Park / This Is Blueprint","Freelance videography inquiry","Declined: in-house content team","2026-10-18","2026-10-20","Watch Blueprint careers and socials for content-team openings; connect with staff at local shows. No second generic freelance pitch.","https://www.thisisblueprint.com/careers","https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/#all/1a15c3e9ad055b2a","Not applicable","Check role hours before applying; protect full-time job.","Team replied that it does not hire freelance videographers and posts openings on its website and socials. This was an inquiry, not a formal job application."],["VFMF-2027","Vancouver Folk Music Festival","Video volunteer committee","Watch: applications spring 2027",null,null,"Prepare two video samples and apply through official volunteer form when it opens.","https://thefestival.bc.ca/volunteer/",null,"Volunteer / unpaid","Past application terms required substantial festival hours; confirm 2027 shifts before applying.","Official site says 2027 applications open spring 2027. New-volunteer guidance requires sample work for Video. Not an open application today."],["SHAMBHALA-2027","Shambhala Music Festival","Photo and Video team","Watch: 2027 team details pending",null,null,"Monitor official Photo and Video route; confirm team availability, compensation, travel and shifts before applying.","https://shambhalamusicfestival.com/get-involved",null,"Unknown","Salmo, BC travel and multi-day shifts; likely conflicts with ordinary 9-to-5 unless leave arranged.","Official site says Photo and Video team space is extremely limited and 2027 details are pending. Press accreditation is a separate route."],["JADE-2026-VIDEO","Jade Music Fest Vancouver","Volunteer videographer","Open: application form available",null,null,"Review programming shifts and apply through organizer form with event-video portfolio; confirm schedule before committing.","https://since1867.ca/jade-music-fest-volunteer-form/",null,"Volunteer / unpaid","Nov 3–8; ask for evening/weekend assignments compatible with full-time job.","Official organizer seeks volunteers with their own equipment and portfolio to film audience, performances and atmosphere; upload footage to staff. Dates Nov 3–8, Granville Island. Deadline not stated."],["BASSCOAST-2027-VIDEO","Bass Coast Festival","In-house videography application","Open: deadline Jan 12, 2027",null,null,"Apply through official video form with public video samples; confirm compensation, deliverables, travel and time off.","https://basscoast.ca/pages/applications/videography","Official application form linked from source","Unknown","July 9–12, 2027 in Merritt, BC; requires travel and likely time off.","Application open Oct 15, 2026–Jan 12, 2027. Separate from press/photo applications. Limited spots. No application submitted."],["OFF2-2026","OFF2 Entertainment: Doomsnight / Dreamstate","Promoter content-team route","Research: no open media role listed",null,null,"Prepare relevant EDM samples; consider a tailored careers inquiry only after reviewing role fit and schedule.","https://off2project.com/careers.html","careers@off2.ca","Unknown","Doomsnight Oct 31 at Pacific Coliseum; Dreamstate Nov 28 at Tradex, Abbotsford. Event shifts may be evening/weekend.","Organizer confirms events and says no open roles currently; public careers inbox accepts introductions for production, lighting, sound, programming or front of house. Videography hiring route unconfirmed."],["ELECTRICSKY-2027","Electric Sky Festival","Media team / capture route","Watch: media applications not yet open",null,null,"Watch official Capture section for 2027 media-team opening; verify location, dates and terms.","https://www.electricsky.ca/get-involved","No media contact verified","Unknown","Event schedule and travel not yet confirmed for this lead.","Official get-involved page says media-team applications for 2027 will open soon. No application or email sent."],["TENNYSON-2026-JADE","Tennyson King at Jade Music Fest","Independent artist management inquiry","Research: artist show verified; filming role unconfirmed",null,null,"Review event time and two relevant samples, then draft a one-show video offer for approval; coordinate filming permission with festival.","https://jmfa.ca/vancouver/","management@tennysonking.com","Unknown","Jade Music Fest Nov 3–8 in Vancouver; exact Showcase G date/time to reconfirm.","Official festival lineup lists Tennyson King in Showcase G; artist official site publicly lists management email. This is a prospect, not a job opening."],["NIGHTLOVELL-2026-VAN","Night Lovell at Commodore Ballroom","Major touring artist / tour-content route","Research: show verified; contact not verified",null,null,"Find authorized management or tour-content contact; do not use ticket/venue inbox as artist hiring route.","https://www.commodoreballroom.com/shows","No artist media contact verified","Unknown","Vancouver show Nov 29, 2026; evening event, subject to permission and shift fit.","Venue lists Nov 29 show. No videography opening, filming approval or management contact verified. Do not pitch until route is confirmed."]]}
